# Ep2 — CLAUDE.md memory (REAL claude, real memory)
Output channels/claude-tricks/assets/ep02/term_claudemd.mp4
Set FontSize 32
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1350
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Shell "bash"

Hide
Type "cd ~/demo-project && rm -f CLAUDE.md && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "cat > CLAUDE.md << 'DONE'"
Enter
Type "# CLAUDE.md"
Enter
Type "stack: Next.js + Supabase"
Enter
Type "style: functional, no classes"
Enter
Type "tests: vitest, colocated"
Enter
Type "never touch: /legacy"
Enter
Type "DONE"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "clear && claude"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Type "what stack do we use and what should you never touch?"
Sleep 1.5s
Enter
Sleep 22s
